abstract: >-
  Experiment code, raw run logs, behavioural graders and analysis for a study
  measuring what generic guidance in an agent system prompt costs and what it
  buys, across 172 runs on two OpenAI GPT-5.6 models.
keywords:
  - prompt engineering
  - LLM agents
  - evaluation
  - system prompts
